406
00:24:03,400 --> 00:24:05,520
I almost couldn't remember who it was.

407
00:24:06,640 --> 00:24:08,920
All right, I'm sorry! Is that enough?

408
00:24:09,840 --> 00:24:11,400
I wasn't mad about that.

409
00:24:20,533 --> 00:24:21,764
Hey.

410
00:24:23,840 --> 00:24:26,560
You should apply to be a trainee
at the soccer club.

411
00:24:26,560 --> 00:24:28,808
The team really needs extra hands.

412
00:24:34,120 --> 00:24:35,631
It's your choice.

413
00:24:36,280 --> 00:24:37,986
I just wanted to invite you.

414
00:24:38,600 --> 00:24:40,413
You love seeing Dunk practice, don't you?

415
00:24:55,800 --> 00:24:56,844
Hey, Jinna.

416
00:24:56,844 --> 00:25:00,480
Check the valve clearance
and see if it's 0.15 mm.

417
00:25:12,600 --> 00:25:15,440
Yeah, the valve clearance is too wide.

418
00:25:15,440 --> 00:25:18,480
No wonder it sounded louder
than rock music during the testing.

419
00:25:18,480 --> 00:25:20,440
Tod, are you free?

420
00:25:20,440 --> 00:25:21,986
Help me check other parts.

421
00:25:27,120 --> 00:25:28,440
Hey, you two,

422
00:25:29,240 --> 00:25:31,040
can we do this later?

423
00:25:31,040 --> 00:25:32,920
I'm hungry.

424
00:25:32,920 --> 00:25:33,960
Damn it, Art.

425
00:25:33,960 --> 00:25:36,280
When are you going to work on this if not now?

426
00:25:36,280 --> 00:25:39,520
It won't be just the three of us
in the afternoon once Anda joins.

427
00:25:39,520 --> 00:25:41,408
There'll be, like, dozens more.

428
00:25:42,310 --> 00:25:44,600
It's nice that he'll be here, isn't it?

429
00:25:44,600 --> 00:25:45,960
Don't you miss him or what?

430
00:25:45,960 --> 00:25:48,000
How often do we get to see him in a month?

431
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:49,320
Though...

432
00:25:49,320 --> 00:25:51,600
I think having a celebrity
as a friend is pretty cool.

433
00:25:51,600 --> 00:25:55,142
All eyes are always on us.
The Communication Arts girls...

434
00:25:56,400 --> 00:26:00,000
Jeez... They weren't looking at you.
They were looking at our friend.

435
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:02,440
You rat! Want a wrench for breakfast?

436
00:26:02,440 --> 00:26:04,680
Hey, enough already, you two.

437
00:26:04,680 --> 00:26:06,320
You're already fighting at this hour.

438
00:26:06,320 --> 00:26:07,960
Let's grab some food.

439
00:26:10,080 --> 00:26:12,560
- Andaman!
- Andaman!

440
00:26:12,560 --> 00:26:15,040
- Andaman.
- Andaman.

441
00:26:15,040 --> 00:26:16,600
Andaman.

442
00:26:16,600 --> 00:26:17,760
Thank you.

443
00:26:18,800 --> 00:26:21,680
- You look very handsome in person.
- Thank you very much.

444
00:26:21,680 --> 00:26:23,560
Can you tell the fans watching the livestream

445
00:26:23,560 --> 00:26:27,400
what you and your characters have in common?

446
00:26:27,400 --> 00:26:29,440
Well, we actually have a lot in common.

447
00:26:29,440 --> 00:26:31,880
My character in the series is
wholesome and romantic,

448
00:26:32,600 --> 00:26:34,880
which is kind of like me in real life.

449
00:26:34,880 --> 00:26:37,120
Is it tough to study Engineering?

450
00:26:37,120 --> 00:26:40,675
Can you tell the younger fans
who may want to study here?

451
00:26:42,040 --> 00:26:43,840
I don't think it's hard.

452
00:26:43,840 --> 00:26:46,800
- If I can do well, then so can you.
- Oh, excellent!

453
00:26:46,800 --> 00:26:50,240
And more importantly,
I've got friends helping me.

454
00:26:50,240 --> 00:26:52,600
Art, Jinna, and Tod.

455
00:26:52,600 --> 00:26:54,320
Shit! He's calling us.

456
00:26:55,680 --> 00:26:57,800
- Hello.
- This is Jinna, Tod,

457
00:26:57,800 --> 00:26:59,080
- and Art.
- Hey...

458
00:26:59,080 --> 00:27:02,200
- Anda looks lovely in this outfit.
- Right.

459
00:27:02,200 --> 00:27:04,160
You're all good-looking here.

460
00:27:04,160 --> 00:27:06,653
Can you promote the series for us?

461
00:27:09,320 --> 00:27:12,720
- Absolutely. Please...
- Jinna is pretty handsome, actually.

462
00:27:12,720 --> 00:27:15,200
What? Do you have another bias?

463
00:27:15,200 --> 00:27:17,160
Or maybe it's you.

464
00:27:17,160 --> 00:27:20,240
- Whatever you hate, you will...
- Hate it even more.

465
00:27:20,240 --> 00:27:21,680
- Thank you to the Andaman fandom
- Sure.

466
00:27:21,680 --> 00:27:23,080
for being here today.

467
00:27:24,520 --> 00:27:26,040
The photos are so lovely.

468
00:27:26,040 --> 00:27:27,520
I'm so happy.

469
00:27:27,520 --> 00:27:29,080
Where are you guys from, by the way?

470
00:27:29,720 --> 00:27:32,680
Anda, it's my friend's birthday today.

471
00:27:35,680 --> 00:27:37,560
Happy birthday, Podduang.

472
00:27:37,560 --> 00:27:39,880
I remember you two. Podduang and Bum.

473
00:27:41,680 --> 00:27:43,680
Thanks, Anda. I...

474
00:27:43,680 --> 00:27:46,320
Can I take selfies with you?

475
00:27:46,320 --> 00:27:48,520
- Sure thing.
- Hey, let me join in, too.

476
00:27:55,440 --> 00:27:57,000
- Thank you.
- Thank you so much.

477
00:27:57,000 --> 00:27:58,680
See you around. Oh, thank you.

478
00:27:58,680 --> 00:28:00,520
- Anda...
- Thank you, everyone.

479
00:28:00,520 --> 00:28:02,200
Thank you for coming.

480
00:28:02,200 --> 00:28:04,840
Thank you, thank you.

481
00:28:04,840 --> 00:28:07,000
Right. Thank you.

482
00:28:07,000 --> 00:28:09,640
- Can I take selfies with you?
- Yes, yes.

483
00:28:12,040 --> 00:28:13,960
Thank you!

484
00:28:13,960 --> 00:28:16,320
<i>Please, everyone.</i>

485
00:28:16,320 --> 00:28:17,960
<i>My team and I</i>

486
00:28:17,960 --> 00:28:19,920
<i>have been working really hard on this series.</i>

487
00:28:19,920 --> 00:28:22,110
<i>That's right. We've been working long and hard.</i>

488
00:28:22,110 --> 00:28:23,580
<i>- It's exhausting. How about you?
- It really is.</i>

489
00:28:23,580 --> 00:28:25,488
<i>- This is our third series now.
- Yes.</i>

490
00:28:25,488 --> 00:28:29,200
<i>Thank you. I hope you'll look forward
to this series.</i>

491
00:28:29,200 --> 00:28:31,000
[Home Ekkamai]

492
00:28:34,600 --> 00:28:38,075
Bum, a ton of people are reposting your post.

493
00:28:41,320 --> 00:28:43,386
What's the matter with you two?

494
00:28:44,080 --> 00:28:46,942
It's my birthday, all right?
Enjoy the moment, will you?

495
00:28:47,880 --> 00:28:49,040
- Right.
- Yeah...

496
00:28:52,066 --> 00:28:54,680
- Here.
- Thank you.

497
00:28:58,680 --> 00:29:00,520
Knock yourselves out.

498
00:29:00,520 --> 00:29:02,680
It's on me tonight.

499
00:29:02,680 --> 00:29:03,964
Sure thing.

500
00:29:04,622 --> 00:29:05,831
Right.

501
00:29:07,080 --> 00:29:09,646
Oh, Bum. This is your brother's place.

502
00:29:10,360 --> 00:29:11,400
Sing me a song.

503
00:29:11,400 --> 00:29:13,160
It's not time for the band to perform yet.

504
00:29:13,160 --> 00:29:15,440
Oh, come on.

505
00:29:15,440 --> 00:29:16,560
Jeez...

506
00:29:16,560 --> 00:29:17,720
Come on, Podduang.

507
00:29:17,720 --> 00:29:20,200
You've been smiling since
Anda wished you a happy birthday.

508
00:29:20,200 --> 00:29:21,364
Let's see.

509
00:29:22,160 --> 00:29:23,560
There.

510
00:29:24,320 --> 00:29:25,564
Look at you.

511
00:29:26,240 --> 00:29:27,440
So cute, right?

512
00:29:33,920 --> 00:29:35,280
Is that Jinna?

513
00:29:35,280 --> 00:29:37,080
This is more than just a coincidence.

514
00:29:42,280 --> 00:29:43,720
Should we get him?

515
00:29:43,720 --> 00:29:45,080
- Hey, hey.
- He upset the birthday boy.

516
00:29:45,080 --> 00:29:46,720
No, not yet.

517
00:29:46,720 --> 00:29:47,840
Let's toast.

518
00:29:53,080 --> 00:29:54,640
- That table.
- Me?

519
00:29:58,680 --> 00:30:03,840
<i>♪ Happy birthday to you ♪</i>

520
00:30:03,840 --> 00:30:08,680
<i>♪ Happy birthday to you ♪</i>

521
00:30:08,680 --> 00:30:14,400
<i>♪ Happy birthday, happy birthday ♪</i>

522
00:30:15,040 --> 00:30:20,400
<i>♪ Happy birthday to you ♪</i>

523
00:30:25,920 --> 00:30:27,160
Want to make a wish first?

524
00:30:39,360 --> 00:30:41,920
<i>I'm Podduang.</i>

525
00:30:41,920 --> 00:30:43,520
<i>And I dunk.</i>

526
00:30:51,280 --> 00:30:53,400
<i>You're finally awake, Sleeping Beauty.</i>

527
00:31:00,040 --> 00:31:04,480
<i>♪ Happy birthday to you ♪</i>

528
00:31:04,480 --> 00:31:06,800
Happy birthday.

529
00:31:10,040 --> 00:31:12,400
- Podduang.
- Hey.

530
00:31:12,400 --> 00:31:15,840
I'm sorry. I really did plan this
with my brother.

